The Mask Makers are a gang that works out of the golden jewelry districts of [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]]. Its members drive cars painted matte black with gold trim. The Party saw several such cars in the parking lot of the [[Geography/Calaria/Ragged Roost|Ragged Roost]] pilgrimage and knew them for the gang's, though the colors sit close to those of [[Divinity/Outer Gods/Judge of Ages|the Judge]] and none of the Party has met the gang itself.
